# Frontend environment (Vite). Copy to .env.local only if you need to override.
#
# By default the frontend calls /api on its own origin: Vite proxies it to the
# local backend in development (vite.config.js), and a Vercel rewrite proxies
# it to Render in production (vercel.json). Leave this unset unless you really
# need to point the browser straight at another API — doing so makes the
# session cookie cross-site, which breaks login.
# VITE_API_URL=
